# {{ project_name }} — AI Agent Guide

This is an **Expo React Native** app (iOS + Android + Web) using Expo SDK 57, Expo Router, Tamagui, and Solito.

## SDK Version

- **Expo SDK**: 57
- **React Native**: 0.86
- **React**: 19.2.3
- **Node.js**: >= 22.13

## Key Conventions

- Use `npx expo` (not `npm` or `npx react-native`) for all CLI commands
- File-based routing via `app/` directory (Expo Router)
- Typed routes are enabled (`experiments.typedRoutes: true` in app.json)
- UI components come from `@{{ monorepo_name }}/ui` (Tamagui) — do not use raw `<View>`/`<Text>` directly; import from `@tamagui/core` or `@{{ monorepo_name }}/ui`
- Navigation uses `solito` for cross-platform `Link` and `useRouter` — do not import from `react-navigation` directly
- Shared code lives in workspace packages: `@{{ monorepo_name }}/ui`, `@{{ monorepo_name }}/app`, `@{{ monorepo_name }}/api`, `@{{ monorepo_name }}/config`

## Commands

```bash
npx expo start                    # Start dev server
npx expo start --ios              # iOS simulator
npx expo start --android          # Android emulator
npx expo start --web              # Web
npx expo export --platform all    # Build for all platforms
npx expo prebuild                 # Generate native ios/ and android/ directories
npx eas-cli build --platform all  # EAS Build
npx eas-cli update --auto         # EAS Update (OTA)
```

## Monorepo Context

This app is part of a pnpm monorepo. Shared packages are in `packages/active/`:

- `@{{ monorepo_name }}/ui` — Tamagui design system
- `@{{ monorepo_name }}/app` — Shared screens (Solito)
- `@{{ monorepo_name }}/api` — API client + zod schemas
- `@{{ monorepo_name }}/config` — Env, theme, constants

Use `workspace:*` for internal dependencies. Use `catalog:` for external dependencies (managed in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`).
